WEBVTT

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:33.551
ROKUMA
SEIKA

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:34.636
MARILYN
OLIVIER

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:35.720
BARITSU
WARDEN

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:36.805
MANDLE
EATON

00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:38.473
DORVAL - BARITE
INSAIGA - CHERRYTON

00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:50.944
THE GREY POLICE HOUND RUNS

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:54.489
Oh, dear me. Hello, greetings, everyone.

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:58.409
I'd like to thank everyone
who gathered here today,

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.079
not only the school headmasters,

00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:03.915
but members of all species big and small.

00:02:03.998 --> 00:02:07.752
Oh, dear, I'm not good at this at all.

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:09.087
Headmaster Gon of Cherryton!

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:12.048
Let's get right into the agenda.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:14.843
We are all gathered here today

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:18.638
because there hasn't been a Beastar
from Cherryton, the top school

00:02:18.721 --> 00:02:21.599
among the prestigious academies,
for the past five years!

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:24.811
You believe we don't need a hero?

00:02:24.894 --> 00:02:26.062
You lack awareness!

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.730
We need a herbivore Beastar!

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.650
Hear that?
The herbivores are screaming again.

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:32.485
I did not want to be here.

00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:35.488
Is it true that Rouis,
the most promising Beastar candidate,

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:37.740
hasn't been attending school?

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.117
What is he doing now?

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.996
Of course, I am hoping
for his return to school as well.

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:48.167
However, I do not intend to have him back
just to appoint him as the Beastar.

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:49.168
With all due respect,

00:02:49.752 --> 00:02:51.880
these students are still kids!

00:02:51.963 --> 00:02:55.884
They study hard, fall in love,
contemplate their existence.

00:02:56.384 --> 00:02:59.971
They each begin to struggle
with their inner instincts.

00:03:00.471 --> 00:03:04.517
The practice of placing a huge
responsibility on a single student…

00:03:05.476 --> 00:03:08.313
I was against it from the beginning.

00:03:09.731 --> 00:03:13.902
A hero isn't something we seek out,
they are supposed to be born!

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:20.325
In other words,

00:03:20.408 --> 00:03:23.328
everyone is a precious student of mine.

00:03:24.454 --> 00:03:26.039
Precious student?

00:03:26.915 --> 00:03:29.709
Even if they were the perpetrator
of the devouring incident?

00:03:29.792 --> 00:03:30.793
What?

00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:32.378
Good grief,

00:03:33.129 --> 00:03:36.341
that was quite the typical
feline laissez-faire-style speech.

00:03:36.424 --> 00:03:38.134
Could that very stance

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:40.803
have led to the devouring incident
on school grounds?

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.431
That incident that happened this spring?

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:45.266
The student was an alpaca.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.726
-The culprit?
-Still on the loose.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.853
According to the police,

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:52.315
it was highly unlikely
to have been committed by an outsider.

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:53.441
What? That's--

00:03:53.524 --> 00:03:54.734
In other words…

00:03:54.817 --> 00:03:55.777
LECTURE ROOM 2

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.655
…it's possible that the perpetrator
is still living on campus

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:00.657
as if nothing happened, is it not?

00:04:01.449 --> 00:04:03.826
It's possible that the Cherryton students

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.913
are still faced with the danger
of being devoured, is it not?

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:18.091
It seems that
the time has come to reveal myself.

00:04:20.969 --> 00:04:23.972
Ever since I discovered your existence,

00:04:24.055 --> 00:04:27.976
my heart would not stop beating fast.

00:04:28.685 --> 00:04:30.645
How do you know me?

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:34.482
I know everything.

00:04:34.565 --> 00:04:38.611
I, the one who possesses six eyes,
have an eye on you.

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:42.991
To continue living a peaceful school life?

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.077
You must be kidding me.

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.669
Excuse me, sounds like the laundry's done.

00:04:55.837 --> 00:04:57.297
Please wait a minute.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:00.800
It gets smelly quick
when it's left in there.

00:05:03.261 --> 00:05:06.222
Facing the snake
who proclaims herself his stalker,

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:09.767
he's able to jump right back
into his own world.

00:05:09.851 --> 00:05:13.688
Not only that, he boldly turns
his back to me. What nerve!

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:20.111
Just as I thought, this wolf's capacity
is expanding infinitely.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.697
How wonderful.

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:26.159
Seeing his body's joints up-close.

00:05:26.743 --> 00:05:28.995
The veins that run through his four limbs.

00:05:29.078 --> 00:05:31.873
His rough and firm fur.

00:05:32.373 --> 00:05:34.292
Bold and yet precise.

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.754
It's already reached the realm of art!

00:05:41.716 --> 00:05:42.633
So…

00:05:43.134 --> 00:05:45.428
Who exactly are you?

00:05:46.971 --> 00:05:48.306
Excuse me.

00:05:48.389 --> 00:05:52.351
I am the only
security guard of this school.

00:05:52.935 --> 00:05:54.854
My name is Six Eyes.

00:05:56.397 --> 00:06:00.318
A security guard?
So, there was one at our school.

00:06:00.985 --> 00:06:05.323
I was at a loss for words
to your demon-like brilliance

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.701
that captivated everyone

00:06:08.785 --> 00:06:11.704
at the welcome performance
for new students.

00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:16.417
Oh, no, that wasn't…
I lost control of myself, too.

00:06:17.001 --> 00:06:18.044
I know.

00:06:18.669 --> 00:06:20.755
Your actions were all triggered

00:06:20.838 --> 00:06:25.510
by the promiscuous Dwarf rabbit
with a little girl-like face.

00:06:26.511 --> 00:06:29.305
The more I investigate,
the more intrigued I get.

00:06:29.931 --> 00:06:34.852
You're a ridiculously tyrannical,
pedophilic, and perverted wolf.

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:39.023
You're the craziest
and most wonderful man of this school.

00:06:39.524 --> 00:06:44.612
I cannot keep you hidden
in the shadows anymore.

00:06:46.364 --> 00:06:52.620
For I know… your true identity.

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.540
But, Ms. Six Eyes,

00:06:56.040 --> 00:07:00.461
why are you hiding
when you're the security guard?

00:07:01.045 --> 00:07:05.633
I'm a security guard,
but a rattle snake first.

00:07:06.384 --> 00:07:11.431
The shame I feel for
my limbless body will haunt me forever.

00:07:13.015 --> 00:07:15.435
I envy you.

00:07:18.729 --> 00:07:22.191
Please tell me, oh, young wolf,

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:25.278
those beautiful limbs of yours,

00:07:25.361 --> 00:07:28.239
what kind of
fighting power do they possess?

00:07:40.209 --> 00:07:43.880
He's showing interest in my body?

00:07:45.047 --> 00:07:46.340
I had no idea

00:07:47.049 --> 00:07:49.635
that there are snakes
with struggles like that.

00:07:50.219 --> 00:07:54.599
No. Is he trying to console me?

00:08:02.607 --> 00:08:04.400
Please wait a minute!

00:08:11.824 --> 00:08:15.369
Just as I thought,
this young man is one of a kind.

00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:18.414
Chase after me.

00:08:19.582 --> 00:08:21.292
Chase after me, young man.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:24.170
You… you will surely…

00:08:36.474 --> 00:08:39.310
The devouring incident
of the alpaca from the Drama Club.

00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:44.941
I haven't been able to pin down
the culprit for the past six months.

00:08:45.816 --> 00:08:48.236
When spring comes,
new students will arrive

00:08:48.319 --> 00:08:50.488
which will completely change
the school environment.

00:08:50.988 --> 00:08:55.451
When that happens,
the murderer may never be caught.

00:08:56.077 --> 00:08:59.789
As being not only a security guard,

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:06.254
but also a fan of yours,
I'd like to request an encore.

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:12.134
You're… telling me to find the murderer?

00:09:13.719 --> 00:09:19.684
Fully utilize your innocent heart
and demonic body and think.

00:09:20.351 --> 00:09:23.312
You should be able to pin him down.

00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:24.772
TEM, SORRY

00:09:32.989 --> 00:09:34.323
Rouis…

00:09:35.783 --> 00:09:36.909
…that being said,

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.787
heroes are naturally born.

00:09:40.329 --> 00:09:43.291
You are right about that, Headmaster Gon.

00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:45.793
If that is the case,

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:48.754
why don't you elect the one

00:09:48.838 --> 00:09:52.842
who pins down the perpetrator
as the Beastar of Cherryton School?

00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:53.926
What?

00:09:56.971 --> 00:10:01.350
Heroes are to be born, are they not?
So, isn't this a good idea?

00:10:02.393 --> 00:10:04.770
How could you say that?

00:10:04.854 --> 00:10:07.857
Well, he's right… It's simple, too.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:10.860
The incident should be
settled as soon as possible.

00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:12.945
Don't be ridiculous!

00:10:13.029 --> 00:10:15.323
Those in agreement, please applaud.

00:10:20.828 --> 00:10:21.829
Okay.

00:10:23.914 --> 00:10:24.957
By the way,

00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:28.419
do you know anything about the murderer?

00:10:29.086 --> 00:10:30.630
I cannot tell you that.

00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:31.714
What?

00:10:32.298 --> 00:10:34.133
It's unreliable information,

00:10:34.216 --> 00:10:37.136
and I don't want you
to wrongfully suspect anyone.

00:10:37.219 --> 00:10:38.179
What?

00:10:38.804 --> 00:10:40.806
In any case, I know you can.

00:10:41.766 --> 00:10:44.769
Please show us your abilities once again.

00:10:45.269 --> 00:10:47.063
For this school.

00:11:03.871 --> 00:11:06.040
Tem was murdered at night, too.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:11.754
Why would he be here, of all places?

00:11:26.102 --> 00:11:27.728
Oh, my gosh, can you believe this?

00:11:27.812 --> 00:11:30.064
Someone stole gym clothes
from the girls dorm again.

00:11:30.147 --> 00:11:31.941
-What? Yesterday?
-Yeah.

00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:34.777
They tell us to be careful, but…

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.112
What happened?

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:38.489
The gym clothes were stolen again.

00:11:39.657 --> 00:11:41.617
The perp must have a pheromone fetish.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.078
Tem's friend might know something.

00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:45.371
TEM - CARL

00:11:45.454 --> 00:11:46.455
But, well…

00:11:46.997 --> 00:11:49.834
Hey, peeper, why the long face?

00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:53.254
Well… I want to try to talk to him,

00:11:53.921 --> 00:11:56.257
but I'm sure I'll scare him
if I approach him too suddenly.

00:11:56.757 --> 00:11:59.468
I was hoping for someone
to connect me to him.

00:12:01.637 --> 00:12:02.680
Hey…

00:12:07.184 --> 00:12:08.185
Here.

00:12:08.269 --> 00:12:10.396
You can talk to Els, right?

00:12:10.479 --> 00:12:12.106
ELS - ADD AS FRIEND - DELETE

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.527
There's something I want to ask him about.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:20.865
Yeah. I really want to
do this for you, Legoshi.

00:12:20.948 --> 00:12:22.032
But…

00:12:23.826 --> 00:12:25.411
-He's my ex-boyfriend.
-What?

00:12:27.204 --> 00:12:28.247
Are you sure?

00:12:28.789 --> 00:12:29.999
Isn't it awkward?

00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:33.127
I haven't spoken to him
in a while, but it's about time.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.463
But, Els… Tem…

00:12:35.546 --> 00:12:38.257
Legoshi, you're the only one
who knows about that.

00:12:40.801 --> 00:12:43.596
Sorry for the interruption, is Carl here?

00:12:44.889 --> 00:12:45.806
Els?

00:12:46.474 --> 00:12:48.309
Do you have a minute?

00:12:50.728 --> 00:12:51.687
It's a wolf!

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:52.938
Why is a carnivore here?

00:12:53.022 --> 00:12:54.023
What's this about?

00:12:54.106 --> 00:12:56.734
Bringing a wolf with you
after all this time? This is unfair.

00:12:57.443 --> 00:13:00.237
I've already moved on
from what happened in the past.

00:13:01.155 --> 00:13:04.783
This is Tem's friend Legoshi
from the Drama Club.

00:13:06.994 --> 00:13:09.413
I'd like to ask you about a few things.

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:14.168
What is it?

00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:18.422
Do you know if Tem
was involved in any kind of trouble?

00:13:19.173 --> 00:13:20.216
What?

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:23.260
Like, maybe, he was arguing with someone?

00:13:23.844 --> 00:13:28.224
Or did he ever go out
by himself in the middle of the night?

00:13:28.849 --> 00:13:30.684
Even if not by himself, with others?

00:13:31.268 --> 00:13:33.145
Hey, what are you trying to…

00:13:35.731 --> 00:13:38.192
-Are you--
-Why do we have to talk to a carnivore?

00:13:38.275 --> 00:13:39.235
Yeah!

00:13:39.318 --> 00:13:41.862
-And anyway, you knew him better than us!
-Yeah!

00:13:41.946 --> 00:13:43.739
Hold on! Just listen!

00:13:46.283 --> 00:13:48.035
Then, do you know
if there are any letters?

00:13:48.118 --> 00:13:49.161
You scare us!

00:13:49.245 --> 00:13:50.663
A diary. How about a diary?

00:13:56.669 --> 00:13:58.045
HAD A PROBLEM WITH ANYONE? - NO

00:13:58.128 --> 00:13:59.547
I've still got nothing.

00:14:00.548 --> 00:14:01.757
What should I do?

00:14:07.846 --> 00:14:10.391
Hey! It's that guy
who was running yesterday.

00:14:10.474 --> 00:14:12.351
I wonder if he runs every night?

00:14:13.894 --> 00:14:16.355
Maybe he saw something
on the night of the incident.

00:14:26.657 --> 00:14:27.783
Excuse me!

00:14:31.287 --> 00:14:34.540
Excuse me, I'd like to ask you something!

00:14:36.959 --> 00:14:39.086
You were running last night, too, right?

00:14:39.169 --> 00:14:40.671
So what?

00:14:40.754 --> 00:14:42.715
Were you running this past April, too?

00:14:43.424 --> 00:14:44.884
Have you seen anyone suspicious?

00:14:45.759 --> 00:14:49.263
Well, I don't remember
what I was doing that far in the past.

00:14:52.099 --> 00:14:53.517
I see.

00:14:56.395 --> 00:14:57.521
Is there something else?

00:14:58.022 --> 00:15:01.191
You're the one stealing the gym clothes
from the girls dorm, aren't you?

00:15:04.194 --> 00:15:05.029
Damn it!

00:15:15.581 --> 00:15:17.207
No luck again.

00:15:21.503 --> 00:15:24.882
Legoshi, I heard
you captured the gym clothes thief.

00:15:24.965 --> 00:15:26.634
Yeah, it was Roger from Boxing Club.

00:15:26.717 --> 00:15:29.219
What? He's that
medal-winning super strong guy!

00:15:29.303 --> 00:15:31.805
Only Legoshi could've captured him.

00:15:31.889 --> 00:15:34.725
-You think?
-Yeah! Way to go!

00:15:34.808 --> 00:15:35.976
The teacher's here.

00:15:47.905 --> 00:15:48.864
Carl…

00:15:55.162 --> 00:15:57.539
"Her blinking was like the spring breeze."

00:15:59.166 --> 00:16:02.670
"Her white coat is like pearls."

00:16:03.879 --> 00:16:07.216
I kinda feel bad reading this.

00:16:09.218 --> 00:16:12.262
"We had some juice
together again after the club."

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.181
With whom?

00:16:14.765 --> 00:16:17.768
"I never thought
I'd be this close to a carnivore."

00:16:18.477 --> 00:16:21.480
"I didn't know
that carnivores had worries, too."

00:16:22.189 --> 00:16:25.234
"Rouis talks about co-existence
and co-prosperity, too."

00:16:25.317 --> 00:16:28.362
I SHOULD TALK TO HIM MORE
BECAUSE WE'RE FRIENDS

00:16:33.909 --> 00:16:36.912
TEM, SORRY

00:16:45.879 --> 00:16:47.047
Ms. Six Eyes!

00:16:48.257 --> 00:16:49.341
Are you here?

00:16:50.718 --> 00:16:55.014
Ms. Six Eyes…

00:16:59.768 --> 00:17:00.978
What is it?

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:04.815
I… finally understand what you said to me.

00:17:06.859 --> 00:17:09.194
Someone once told me,

00:17:09.862 --> 00:17:13.449
"Why don't you take responsibility
for your own strength?"

00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:18.328
I don't want his apology to be in vain.

00:17:19.913 --> 00:17:23.792
So that's why I will capture
the culprit with my own hands.

00:17:25.669 --> 00:17:28.630
Then, in honor of your determination…

00:17:31.008 --> 00:17:34.553
the clue… is within you.

00:17:43.645 --> 00:17:46.398
I heard you've been going at it lately,

00:17:46.482 --> 00:17:49.318
but how could you go around
offering such a foolish deal?

00:17:50.444 --> 00:17:53.572
For you to live out
your natural span of life as a turtle,

00:17:53.655 --> 00:17:55.699
I need you to be in on it, too.

00:17:57.034 --> 00:17:59.953
We, Shishi-Gumi,
will do everything to protect you.

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:03.624
Just give us
half of the profit from your business.

00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:05.751
Not a bad deal, isn't it?

00:18:06.627 --> 00:18:08.712
The Black Market is dangerous these days.

00:18:09.505 --> 00:18:12.049
Inari-Gumi formed by foxes,

00:18:12.841 --> 00:18:14.426
Madara-Gumi formed by jaguars,

00:18:15.052 --> 00:18:16.804
Doku-Gumi formed by monitor lizards.

00:18:17.805 --> 00:18:21.475
We'll protect you
from those screwed up bastards.

00:18:22.351 --> 00:18:23.769
Don't make me laugh.

00:18:23.852 --> 00:18:28.107
The prime example of a screwed up
organization is you, Shishi-Gumi!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:32.736
No, Shishi-Gumi has changed.

00:18:34.446 --> 00:18:37.741
In any case, there's no point
speaking to you underlings.

00:18:37.825 --> 00:18:39.910
Bring me your boss.

00:18:44.206 --> 00:18:45.374
Please.

00:18:54.216 --> 00:18:55.467
Good grief.

00:18:56.426 --> 00:18:58.679
Then allow me to apologize first…

00:19:00.055 --> 00:19:02.057
for Shishi-Gumi's past mistakes.

00:19:05.477 --> 00:19:06.812
Don't worry.

00:19:07.646 --> 00:19:10.274
Leave the disciplining
of these cats to me, the boss.

00:19:12.025 --> 00:19:13.861
So, the rumors are true.

00:19:14.444 --> 00:19:16.572
A herbivore has become the boss.

00:19:18.157 --> 00:19:20.409
Business is tough, right, Store Owner?

00:19:21.326 --> 00:19:22.703
So use me.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.664
In order for the sales to recover,

00:19:25.747 --> 00:19:28.876
we need to bring back those hypocrites.

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:35.507
What carnivores desperately
need right now is "forgiveness."

00:19:36.967 --> 00:19:41.471
They'll come back as soon as there's
a herbivore that encourages business

00:19:41.555 --> 00:19:43.515
at the Black Market.

00:19:45.434 --> 00:19:46.935
Now, I advise you

00:19:47.019 --> 00:19:52.024
to be smart and contribute to the peace
of society with the new Shishi-Gumi.

00:19:53.734 --> 00:19:55.736
Hold up. Before we go any further,

00:19:56.486 --> 00:19:58.155
have you lost your mind?

00:19:59.823 --> 00:20:01.283
You're here inside

00:20:02.242 --> 00:20:04.036
of a deer meat butcher shop.

00:20:05.454 --> 00:20:06.538
So what?

00:20:07.831 --> 00:20:10.959
You carnivores are very much mistaken.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.504
This world is divided
into two types of beasts.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.549
They're not carnivores and herbivores.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:21.678
Two types
that are more complex and obvious.

00:20:23.472 --> 00:20:25.224
Winners and losers.

00:20:26.183 --> 00:20:27.559
That's all.

00:20:35.192 --> 00:20:37.361
This world is tainted with lies.

00:20:38.487 --> 00:20:41.490
As long as herbivores
continue to ignore the truth,

00:20:41.573 --> 00:20:43.325
they'll be devoured no matter what.

00:20:44.993 --> 00:20:48.163
I'm going to obtain
true strength this time.

00:20:49.081 --> 00:20:52.876
Believing in myself
and the wickedness of carnivores.

00:20:56.755 --> 00:20:57.965
Hey, Free,

00:20:58.048 --> 00:21:00.300
you had a look that said
you saw something delicious.

00:21:00.968 --> 00:21:01.969
No…

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:17.776
Never forget the pact we made, all right?

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:48.325
Subtitle translation by: Kanako Murakoshi
